<!doctype html><html lang="es"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><style>@media(max-width:480px){.welcome-backdrop{background-size:560px 100%!important}.mail-column{display:block!important;width:100%!important}.welcome-title{font-size:40px!important;line-height:43px!important;letter-spacing:-0.5px!important}.welcome-copy{font-size:17px!important;line-height:23px!important}.welcome-footer{font-size:9px!important;letter-spacing:0.3px!important}.welcome-instagram{width:9px!important;height:9px!important}.welcome-code{font-size:18px!important;letter-spacing:1px!important}}</style></head><body style="margin:0;background:#111111;color:#eeeeee;"><div style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;">Tu selección sigue en la cesta. Tú decides cómo termina.</div><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td align="center"><table role="presentation" width="100%" style="width:100%;max-width:640px;border-collapse:collapse;"><tr><td bgcolor="#0b0b0b" style="padding:24px 24px 0px 24px;text-align:left;color:#eeeeee;background-color:#0b0b0b;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6"><table role="presentation" width="100%"><tr><td class="mail-column" valign="top" width="100%"><table role="presentation" width="100%"><tr><td bgcolor="#0b0b0b" style="padding:10px 10px 10px 10px;text-align:left;color:#eeeeee;background-color:#0b0b0b;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.5"><img src="https://cronox.es/assets/mail/order-confirmation/logo-dark.png" alt="CRONOX" width="148" style="display:block;width:100%;max-width:148px;margin:0px" /></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#0b0b0b" style="padding:10px 10px 10px 10px;text-align:left;color:#eeeeee;background-color:#0b0b0b;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:26px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.2"><h2 style="margin:0">Si acabó en tu cesta, por algo sería.</h2></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#0b0b0b" style="padding:10px 10px 10px 10px;text-align:left;color:#eeeeee;background-color:#0b0b0b;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6">Lo dejaste en la cesta y seguiste a lo tuyo. Ahora puedes volver justo donde lo dejaste.</td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#0b0b0b" style="padding:10px 10px 2px 10px;text-align:left;color:#eeeeee;background-color:#0b0b0b;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.6"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td width="28" valign="middle"><img src="https://cronox.es/assets/mail/global-footer/basket-dark.png" width="18" height="18" alt="Cesta" style="display:block;border:0" /></td><td valign="middle" style="font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:#eeeeee">Tu selección</td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#0b0b0b" style="padding:0px 10px 10px 10px;text-align:left;color:#eeeeee;background-color:#0b0b0b;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6">{{#each items}}<table class="cart-mail-product" role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;border-top:1px solid #38383c;background:transparent;color:#eeeeee"><tr><td width="80" valign="middle" style="padding:12px 10px 12px 0"><table class="cart-mail-thumbnail" role="presentation" width="70" height="70" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:70px;height:70px;table-layout:fixed;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td width="70" height="70" align="center" valign="middle" style="width:70px;height:70px;padding:0;line-height:0">{{#if imageUrl}}<img src="{{imageUrl}}" alt="{{name}}" width="70" height="70" style="display:block;width:70px;height:70px;margin:0;padding:0;border:0" />{{/if}}</td></tr></table></td><td valign="middle" style="padding:12px 8px 12px 0;color:#eeeeee"><strong>{{name}}</strong><br /><span style="font-size:12px;color:#b7b7bb">Talla {{variantName}} · Cantidad {{quantity}}</span></td><td align="right" valign="middle" style="padding:12px 0;color:#eeeeee;white-space:nowrap;font-size:13px"><strong>{{lineTotalFormatted}}</strong></td></tr></table>{{else}}<p>No hay prendas disponibles.</p>{{/each}}</td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#0b0b0b" style="padding:14px 14px 14px 14px;text-align:left;color:#eeeeee;background-color:#0b0b0b;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.6"><a href="{{actionUrl}}" style="display:inline-block;padding:14px 14px;background:#ffffff;color:#111111;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.6;border-radius:2px;text-decoration:none">VOLVER A MI CESTA</a></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#0b0b0b" style="padding:10px 10px 0px 10px;text-align:left;color:#b7b7bb;background-color:#0b0b0b;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6">Las prendas no están reservadas. El precio y la disponibilidad se actualizarán al volver a tu cesta.</td></tr></table></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>